{"4462510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nature's Bidding", "steam_appid": 4462510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature's Bidding is a multiplayer roguelike action game where you craft exciting builds through auctions to fight against your friends and other online foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play with up to 4 friends in an all out brawl. Bid on cursed masks and cards before every round and craft</i> <i>the most exciting builds possible through the pre-battle shop. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid on ancient masks that affect your fighter in a unique way, and open possibilities for unique builds and strategies in combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your arsenal with super powered cards that you can use mid-battle to surprise opponents and strike effective blows.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an exciting pre-battle shop filled with randomized items so unique that no two runs ever feel the same!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against other powered up foes in colorful high-speed combat. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Environment as it shifts and changes as time progresses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for each round as you aim to be at the top of the podium at the end!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature's Bidding is a multiplayer roguelike action game where you craft exciting builds through auctions to fight against your friends and other online foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play with up to 4 friends in an all out brawl. Bid on cursed masks and cards before every round and craft</i> <i>the most exciting builds possible through the pre-battle shop. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bid on ancient masks that affect your fighter in a unique way, and open possibilities for unique builds and strategies in combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your arsenal with super powered cards that you can use mid-battle to surprise opponents and strike effective blows.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an exciting pre-battle shop filled with randomized items so unique that no two runs ever feel the same!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against other powered up foes in colorful high-speed combat. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Environment as it shifts and changes as time progresses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for each round as you aim to be at the top of the podium at the end!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Nature is Calling! Equipped with powerful masks, battle in high speed multiplayer action to be the warrior on top! In this action roguelike, bid against your opponents, build unique archetypes in the shop, and fight to your heart's desire for the top prize!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462510/f7a9917b88da938c0e7dcdf3f72c2e0ea4cb1ec6/header.jpg?t=1787149160", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462510/91605de782d1dd8c5b5677f9d4b30843a960b61f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787149160", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4462510/91605de782d1dd8c5b5677f9d4b30843a960b61f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787149160", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum